            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_K6hjMn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We love a good pin, but have you met the artists behind ‘em? They’re the real MVPs. Fighting for their passion, while getting knocked down over and over again as their art is stolen and mass produced by large corporations.</p><p>We created this community to lift up these makers, shout their names from the tallest rooftops, and share their art with the world—giving credit where credit is due.</p>"
          }
        },
